# dsh 数据目录里的本机内容：密钥、会话记录、运行时生成的文件
.dsh-home/.env
.dsh-home/.credentials.yaml
.dsh-home/.anonymous-user-id
.dsh-home/sessions/
.dsh-home/storages/
.dsh-home/deepseek-harness/
.dsh-home/logs/
.dsh-home/profiles/*/node_modules/
.dsh-home/profiles/*/.plugin-manager/
.cordis/
